<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wiser Oil started at buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wiser Oil started at buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co said Tuesday it initiated coverage of Wiser Oil Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Jack Aydin said in a report he expects the crude oil and natural gas company to earn $0.35 a share in 1996 and $0.55 in 1997 versus a loss of $0.59 in 1995 (adjusted for securities and property sales gains and some charges).</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 to 18-1/2 on the New York Stock Exchange. Aydin said his price target was $24.</p>
<p>((Cleveland Newsdesk, Susan Zimmerman 216-579-0077))</p>
